  "name": "Vaporah the Elemeind",
  "description": "Based on a design from the collection Stray Aliens: #9 - Vaporah Elemeind\nhttps://opensea.io/assets/ethereum/0x495f947276749ce646f68ac8c248420045cb7b5e/57124830429581407560204282384407541915263222877884187177766534221515171299329\n\n\"We located Vaporah near the Elemeind home planet. She was flourishing on a small water planet, surrounded by all sorts of aquatic creatures that had grown attached to her. Vaporah agreed to come with our crew because she knows that reconnecting with Floraleen (#3) is best for the family as well as Earthereum.\n\nVaporah is eager to help the human race as well as the creatures of Earthereum. She hopes to permanently relocate with her sisters and to try to find their balance again. As long as they are nearby, she will feel ok.\n\nVaporah will require basic care. She tends to seek out social settings as much as possible. In fact, she makes friends with all sorts of critters! Vaporah can attract aquatic creatures & they tend to stick by her side. This social skill is something that goes along with her unique attachment to H20. We have agreed to allow Vaporah to travel with pets as she sees fit.\"",
